  <!-- EN: barogoth -->
  <DA_Barog.label>巴罗格斯</DA_Barog.label>
  <!-- EN: A large herbivorous amphibian that thrives in humid environments. Barogoth are often found near swamps and wetlands, where they will mate and lay eggs for the great majority of their lives. Quite docile when tamed, they are regularly used as pack animals.\n\nBarogoth secrete a thick oily liquid that can be collected and used as a medicinal ointment. While applied on the body, it increase one's recovery against diseases and physical traumas. -->
  <DA_Barog.description>一种在潮湿环境繁育的大型两栖草食动物。人们经常在沼泽和湿地附近看到巴罗格斯，它们大部分时间于此交配产卵。它们被驯服后非常温顺，经常被用作驮畜。\n\n巴罗格斯分泌一种粘稠的油状液体，可以收集起来用作药膏。当涂抹在身体上时，它会增加一个人对疾病和身体创伤的恢复。</DA_Barog.description>
