  <!-- EN: barogoth oil -->
  <DA_BarogOil.label>巴罗格斯油</DA_BarogOil.label>
  <!-- EN: The potent oil extracted from a barogoth, it is often applied on the body to help the body recover from various diseases and traumas. -->
  <DA_BarogOil.description>从巴罗格斯提取的强效油脂，通常外用以帮助身体从各种疾病和创伤中恢复。</DA_BarogOil.description>
