  <!-- EN: barogoth egg (fert.) -->
  <EggBarogFertilized.label>巴罗格斯卵（已受精）</EggBarogFertilized.label>
  <!-- EN: A fertilized barogoth egg. If all goes well, it should hatch into a barogoth newt. It can be eaten raw, but it's much better cooked. -->
  <EggBarogFertilized.description>已受精的巴罗格斯卵。如果一切顺利，应该会孵化出小巴罗格斯。能生食，但最好煮熟了吃。</EggBarogFertilized.description>
  
  <!-- EN: barogoth egg (unfert.) -->
  <EggBarogUnfertilized.label>巴罗格斯卵（未受精）</EggBarogUnfertilized.label>
  <!-- EN: The unfertilized egg of a barogoth. It can be eaten raw, but it's much, much better cooked. -->
  <EggBarogUnfertilized.description>已受精的巴罗格斯卵。能生食，但最好煮熟了吃。</EggBarogUnfertilized.description>
  
